details 
Login/signup now appears first.
User must select whether they are logging in as Admin or Member.
Backend verifies email, password, and role.
Passwords are hashed using Node crypto.
Auth uses bearer tokens.
Admin can create projects, add/remove members, create/assign/delete tasks.
Member only sees admin-allocated projects and assigned tasks.
Member can update assigned task status only.
Dashboard shows total tasks, status counts, tasks per user, and overdue tasks.
